Article 31
The Regional Government is responsible for:
a. implementing activities to ensure the fulfillment of women's rights;
b. providing facilities and infrastructure for the protection of women;
c. applying minimum service standards in women's protection services and standard operating procedures for repatriation and social reintegration that are in effect;
d. providing implementing officers and functional officers at the UPTD

